H 65822
	Ohashi Station was originally constructed to process all requests for entry into the New Tokyo System by foreigners. As entry requirements were relaxed, however, Ohashi transitioned into a base of operations for the Kusari State Police, who patrols the area to suppress the activities of the Blood Dragons.

H 65823
	CLASS: Nostromo
	AMENITIES: Limited
