	The prison station \iHuntsville\I, under the control of Liberty Police, Inc. (LPI), is commonly referred to by prisoners and locals alike as “The Walls.” Xenos make up a large percentage of the population and are isolated here to minimize exposure to other inmates in the penal system. Apart from the prisoners and jailers, the Bounty Hunters Guild also maintains an onboard presence in the event of any unforeseen escape attempts.

